WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
 What's your point of view about the artist saying,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.440
 "They stole my work and AI prompting is not art."

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.880
 Do you understand the backlash?

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:11.380
 >> Yeah. They say they trained on my data,

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.740
 on my art, and now it's

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.940
 using my techniques to create new art for other people.

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.480
 AI will steal it.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.900
 Not even steal it, it will just copy it, create something.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.840
 Even if it does it by itself and it

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.880
 goes through the same steps as you have done,

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.080
 it will come to the same result.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.280
 >> That's possible. Don't complain,

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.820
 just go and earn money with AI

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:34.120
 because of so many opportunities that you get.

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.760
 Be creative and use AI to go even further.

